// GetDpuCounters — typed per-DPU counter rollup (PE-3a / PE-G8).
//
// While GetCounters returns the bag of synthetic counters scoped to a single
// (kind, key) tuple, GetDpuCounters returns a single response carrying
// rollups at three nested scopes:
